:"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_10","text":"but I'm most intrigued by your rock paper scissors technique.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_11","text":"You could say I've been obsessing over it lately :/","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_12","text":"Actually, I was pretty surprised myself","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_13","text":"that you managed to win three times in a row.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_14","text":"What's your secret?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_15","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_15","text":"Rock paper scissors is all about mind games.","jump":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_17"},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_16","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_16","text":"It was just dumb luck.","jump":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_30"},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_17","text":"Whoa, no kidding?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_18","text":"How do you do it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_19","text":"Generally speaking, you can tell what someone is about to throw by looking at their hands.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_20","text":"How so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_21","text":"Your hand tends to relax a bit before throwing scissors.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_22","text":"Wow, really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_23","text":"Meanwhile, your hand tends to tense up if you're going with rock.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_24","text":"No kidding...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_25","text":"So you were able to notice all of these subtle movements while you were playing the game?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_26","text":"That's amazing!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_27","text":"Just kidding.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_28","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_29","text":"I just got lucky.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_30","text":"Oh... is that so...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_31","text":"Wait a minute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_32","text":"You must have had Blanc and Noir help you out beforehand, didn't you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_33","text":"Yep!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_34","text":"We gave his luck a jump start!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_35","text":"Well, aren't you two just","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_36","text":"the epitome of luck?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_37","text":"Where are you right now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_38","text":"Hanging out in the dormitory.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_39","text":"Why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_40","text":"Today's coin flip was tails.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_41","text":"Give me some luck! I need it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_42","text":"Fill 'er up!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_43","text":"I'm coming over.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_44","text":"Nope, sorry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx777_06_45","text":"Only Pit Boss can do that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_bunnyx777_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_bunnyx7